# Accounts made by a test. Each one is deleted by the admin when the test ends (Island Hop only
# marks it deleted, so it stays in the table, hidden); {unique} keeps every run's address new.

Phrase: <user> signs up as "<email>"
  As <user>:
    go to signup page
    type "HumanTest Traveller" in "Full Name"
    click "Next Step"
    type "<email>" in "Email Address"
    type "+8801712345678" in "Phone Number"
    click "Next Step"
    type "Test@12345" in "Create Password"
    type "Test@12345" in "Confirm Password"
    click "Complete Registration"
    backend should receive POST /api/v1/auth/register
    backend should reply 201 Created
    remember data.userId as new account
  As admin:
    at the end, call DELETE /api/v1/users/{new account}
